WEBVTT

00:11:59.741 --> 00:12:02.815
is that you people will do anything
for cancer, and I love that.

00:12:02.839 --> 00:12:05.736
You bike across the state,
you walk up and down the river.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:07.300
(Laughter)

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:10.216
I've never seen, really, anywhere,

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:13.483
this unique support for cancer research.

00:12:13.507 --> 00:12:15.264
And so I want to thank you

00:12:15.288 --> 00:12:18.585
for your participation, your collaboration

00:12:18.609 --> 00:12:19.770
and most of all,

00:12:19.794 --> 00:12:21.728
for your confidence in our ideas.

00:12:21.752 --> 00:12:27.253
(Applause)